            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                <p n="1-7">
                    Here lies buried Cornelis Claesen,
                    young in his life,
                    chief navigator from Amsterdam,
                    who died 26 years old,
                    on 3rd April 1667.
                </p>       
